      "current_tex": "\\begin{proposition}[Infimum in the Set Is the Minimum]\n\\label{prop:infimum-in-the-set-is-the-minimum}\nLet $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}$ be nonempty and bounded below, and let\n$i=\\inf A$. If $i\\in A$, then\n\\[\n  i=\\min A.\n\\]\n\n\\hyperref[prf:infimum-in-the-set-is-the-minimum]{Go to proof.}\n\\end{proposition}",
